---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About us"
	description="Meet Maggie, Bailey, Mum and Dad."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-09-27')}
	showMeta={false}
>
	<p>
		This blog is written by us, the dogs. Dad helps with the typing because our paws are too big
		for the keyboard. He says he checks the spelling, but we're pretty sure he just laughs a lot.
	</p>

	<h2>🎾 Maggie</h2>
	<p>
		I love balls. All balls. Big ones, small ones, squeaky ones and the soggy ones under the couch
		that Mum says are "disgusting". I also love children, because children have sticky hands and
		they always want to throw the ball. If I like you, I will lick you. If I really like you, I will
		lick you more.
	</p>

	<h2>💨 Bailey</h2>
	<p>
		I do zoomies. Fast ones. But only with dogs my size. The tiny ones get under my feet and the
		giant ones don't understand the rules. When I find a dog who's just right, it's laps of the park
		until someone's tongue is hanging out (usually mine).
	</p>

	<h2>🛋️ Mum &amp; Dad</h2>
	<p>
		Dad is in charge of walks, dinner and saying "who's a good dog?" (it's us). Mum is in charge of
		the most important job in the whole house: cuddles on the couch at the end of the day. We both
		squeeze in, even though there isn't really room, and nobody minds.
	</p>
</Layout>
